# DOMAIN,epdg.epc.mnc000.mcc454.pub.3gppnetwork.org
# MNC 002: HKT / PCCW-HKT 骨干网 (电讯盈科基础承载网)
# DOMAIN,epdg.epc.mnc002.mcc454.pub.3gppnetwork.org
# MNC 018: Club Sim 专属网段 (轻量化预付卡与 eSIM 业务核心)
# DOMAIN,epdg.epc.mnc018.mcc454.pub.3gppnetwork.org

# ----------------- 3. 和记电讯 (3 HK / SoSIM / SUPREME) -----------------
