# DOMAIN,epdg.epc.mnc003.mcc454.pub.3gppnetwork.org
# MNC 004: SoSIM 专用网关 (百佳/屈臣氏渠道储值卡核心节点)
# DOMAIN,epdg.epc.mnc004.mcc454.pub.3gppnetwork.org
# MNC 005: SUPREME 尊贵品牌与商业专用核心网节点
# DOMAIN,epdg.epc.mnc005.mcc454.pub.3gppnetwork.org

# ----------------- 4. 中国移动香港 (CMHK / CMLink) -----------------
# MNC 012: CMHK 个人主网 (香港本地月费卡与主干 IMS 注册网关)
# DOMAIN,epdg.epc.mnc012.mcc454.pub.3gppnetwork.org
# MNC 013: CMLink 与预付费储值卡 (全球漫游及大湾区跨境专用出口)
# DOMAIN,epdg.epc.mnc013.mcc454.pub.3gppnetwork.org

# ----------------- 5. 数码通 (SmarTone) -----------------
